### Release Notes

<details>
<summary>prettier/prettier (prettier)</summary>

### [`v3.7.2`](https://redirect.github.com/prettier/prettier/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#372)

[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/prettier/prettier/compare/3.7.1...3.7.2)

